# Settings + Realtime + Notifications

UI/UX source of truth: `Master UI-UX Design Constitution.md` + `.cursor/docs/theme.md`.
Ovaj fajl ne definiše stil, layout ni paletu.

## Realtime (opt-in)

- Socket.IO je obavezan kada projekat implementira realtime za: tickets/chat, notifications, settings.
  Ako projektni zahtjev kaže drugačije, dokumentuj odluku u planu i matrici.

## Settings contract (obavezno)

- Imati registry (public/private) + secret handling.
  UI: boolean→switch, number→number input, string→text; opis uz svaki key.
  Vizuelni tretman settings ekrana prati Constitution (ne card-grid, ne dekoracija).

## Responsive UX

- Full responsive. Desktop je primarni workspace (Constitution §33).
  Mobile breakpoint: prefer drawer/sheet umjesto modal dialoga.

## Notifications baseline

- In-app obavezno.
  Email/push samo kad je eksplicitno traženo (može feature-flagged stub).
  Hijerarhija i toast disciplina: Constitution §32 (ne toast za svaku trivijalnu akciju).
